{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"That`s How Love Starts, Ya Know!\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-04\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Momo believes in ghosts. Okarun believes in aliens. To make each other believe what they deny, they head to a spot famous for UFO sightings and a spiritual hotspot.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10165016/screencap/66fbed845192d.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"それって恋のはじまりじゃんよ\"},{\"title\":\"That`s a Space Alien, Ain`t It?!\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-11\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Momo awakens psychic powers, while Okarun is cursed by Turbo Granny. They evacuate to Momo's house, but a giant alien appears before them.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10624765/screencap/67051b58d2854.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"それって宇宙人じゃね\"},{\"title\":\"It`s a Granny vs. Granny Clash!\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-18\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"After Momo's grandmother temporarily suppresses the evil spirit within Okarun, she says that a game of tag may be the key to defeating it for good.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10624768/screencap/670e44c3bc7bf.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ババアとババアが激突じゃんか\"},{\"title\":\"Kicking Turbo Granny`s Ass\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2024-10-25\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Okarun and Momo arrive at the tunnel to confront Turbo Granny. Just when they think they've won, a giant crab spirit crashes through the wall.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10624770/screencap/671796442ce25.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ターボババアをぶっ飛ばそう\"},{\"title\":\"Like, Where Are Your Balls?!\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2024-11-01\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Momo and Okarun’s ordeal with Turbo Granny has brought them closer, but things remain awkward between them. Okarun realizes he still has a problem.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10624772/screencap/6720b52b74fbd.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"タマはどこじゃんよ\"},{\"title\":\"A Dangerous Woman Arrives\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2024-11-08\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Turbo Granny reveals that Okarun's missing organs are contained within golden spheres. Aira, who has found one, now has the ability to see spirits.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10624774/screencap/6729f5f588fc4.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ヤベー女がきた\"},{\"title\":\"To a Kinder World\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2024-11-15\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Momo and Okarun manage to weaken Acrobatic Silky but make a shocking discovery regarding Aira. Acrobatic Silky suggests a surprising way to help.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10624775/screencap/6733506202d43.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"優しい世界へ\"},{\"title\":\"I`ve Got This Funny Feeling\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2024-11-22\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Aira begins to develop a crush on Okarun. As the three friends' emotions intertwine, they suddenly face another extraterrestrial emergency.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10624776/screencap/673c80844114e.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"なんかモヤモヤするじゃんよ.\"},{\"title\":\"Merge! Serpo Dover Demon Nessie!\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2024-11-29\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Aira has awakened the powers of Acrobatic Silky within her and fights the Serpoians alongside Okarun and Momo.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10624777/screencap/6745a0f316167.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"合体! セルポドーバーデーモンネッシー!\"},{\"title\":\"Have You Ever Seen a Cattle Mutilation?\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2024-12-06\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Okarun and the girls try to clean up some misunderstandings with their classmates. The aquatic creature reappears before Momo and Aira.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/v4/episode/10624778/screencap/674eef2ae65ea.jpg